)($form['poznamka']??''))?>"></label><button class="btn primary span-3"><?=$editCage?'Uložit změny':'+ Přidat ubikaci'?></button></form><?php if($editCage&&(int)($editCage['animal_count']??0)===0):?><form method="post" class="danger-zone" onsubmit="return confirm('Trvale smazat ubikaci?')"><?=ir_csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$editCage['id']?>"><button class="btn danger" name="action" value="delete-cage">Smazat ubikaci</button></form><?php endif?></section>
